      "duration": 1.3,
      "comment": "说到“为一体”的时候刚好做到这个动作"
    },
    {
      "type": "hold",
      "duration": 2.0
    },
    {
      "type": "snapshot",
      "path": "snapshots/default_walkrun.json",
      "duration": 1.3,
      "comment": "手动归位"
    },
    {
      "type": "hold",
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "type": "snapshot",
      "path": "snapshots/point_front.json",
      "duration": 1.3,
      "comment": "说到“推动经济社会的数字化转型”时正好指向前方，以这个动作表示“推动”"
    },
    {
    "type": "hold",
    "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "type": "snapshot",
      "path": "snapshots/question_pose.json",
      "duration": 1.3,
      "comment": "说到“首次提出”的时候右手可以做个提出的动作"
    },
    {
      "type": "snapshot",
      "path": "snapshots/welcome_open_arms.json",
      "duration": 1.3,
      "comment": "说到“同年8月” 这个时候执行这个动作会把左手也抬上来"
    },
    {
    "type": "hold",
    "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "type": "snapshot",
      "path": "snapshots/default_walkrun.json",
      "duration": 1.3,
      "comment": "讲完后,手动归位"
    }
